{"id":"53fddde91ae3f682","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-letterless-trace-code.md","title":"Correctness of Finite-Cofinite Trace Codes","display":"lem-letterless-trace-code — Correctness of Finite-Cofinite Trace Codes","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-letterless-trace-code","aliases":["89-lem-letterless-trace-code"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-letterless-trace-code — Correctness of Finite-Cofinite Trace Codes","depends_on":["[[89-df-letterless-trace]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-letterless-trace-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-letterless-trace-code</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-letterless-trace-code — Correctness of Finite-Cofinite Trace Codes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f8d035bfd71a4ab\" href=\"?note=4f8d035bfd71a4ab\" title=\"89-df-letterless-trace\">89-df-letterless-trace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tc}\">\\(\\mathrm{tc}\\)</span> 为有效迹码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{den}\">\\(\\operatorname{den}\\)</span> 为码的集合解释。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FC}\">\\(\\mathsf{FC}\\)</span> 为有限/余有限码集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tr}\">\\(\\mathrm{tr}\\)</span> 为集合迹。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}trace\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{tc}(A)\\in\\mathsf{FC}\\land\n\\operatorname{den}(\\mathrm{tc}(A))=\\mathrm{tr}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}trace\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{tc}(A)\\in\\mathsf{FC}\\land\n\\operatorname{den}(\\mathrm{tc}(A))=\\mathrm{tr}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 95–96；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>对公式树归纳。底、补集、四种交集码直接验证。若输入迹为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>，盒迹仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>；否则令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 为最小缺失自然数，定义中的全称条件对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\le k\">\\(n\\le k\\)</span> 成立，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;k\">\\(n&gt;k\\)</span> 失败，恰给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}\\)</span>。这证明码算法，同时证明每个无字母迹有限或余有限。它不靠“未搜到反例”确认有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-letterless-trace","status":"resolved","id":"4f8d035bfd71a4ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-trace]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{den}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{FC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}trace\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{tc}(A)\\in\\mathsf{FC}\\land\n\\operatorname{den}(\\mathrm{tc}(A))=\\mathrm{tr}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"n\\le k","display":false},{"tex":"n>k","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1248,"backlinks":[{"id":"c45e0059ab7065e5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-formula]] → [[89-df-finite-frame-rank]] → [[89-lem-finite-rank-successors]] → [[89-df-letterless-trace]] → [[89-lem-letterless-trace-code]] → [[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]] → [[89-df-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-thm-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["4f8d035bfd71a4ab"]}